COMPILATION OF: E46N18

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46N18

   1 a 0000 E46N18:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2c] FILE SKIP WITH AN EXPRESSION COUNT.
   4 a 0006      COPYLPT:81 `skip(spaces)' is 030C-0321 = attach,
   5 a 0006      LHLD, MOV A,L, ?SKPOP, ?QIOOP -- 22 bytes, two more
   6 a 0006      than the literal form. */
   7 c 0006   dcl outf file, n fixed bin;
   8 c 0006   n = 3;
   9 c 000C   open file(outf) stream output title('N18OUT DAT');
  10 c 0029   put file(outf) skip(n);
  11 c 003F   close file(outf);
  12 a 0045 end E46N18;

CODE SIZE = 0048
DATA AREA = 000C
FREE SYMS = 389A
END  COMPILATION
